WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.424 --> 00:00:03.269
打开 Composer / Open Composer

2
00:00:03.269 --> 00:00:06.168
新建 Query 与重发请求 / Create the Query and replay request

3
00:00:06.168 --> 00:00:09.060
在 URL 中填写 guide=url / Enter guide=url in the URL

4
00:00:09.060 --> 00:00:11.958
选择 POST / Select POST

5
00:00:11.958 --> 00:00:14.810
打开仍为空的 Query 表格 / Open the still-empty Query table

6
00:00:14.810 --> 00:00:17.659
填写 Query 名称 guide / Enter the Query name guide

7
00:00:17.659 --> 00:00:20.458
填写 Query 值 table / Enter the Query value table

8
00:00:20.458 --> 00:00:23.312
添加 guide=table / Add guide=table

9
00:00:23.312 --> 00:00:26.158
再次填写同名 guide / Enter the duplicate name guide

10
00:00:26.158 --> 00:00:28.958
填写第二行值 again / Enter the second row value again

11
00:00:28.958 --> 00:00:31.808
添加第二条同名 Query / Add the second same-name Query row

12
00:00:31.808 --> 00:00:34.908
发送并核对三个 guide 值 / Send and verify all three guide values

13
00:00:34.908 --> 00:00:37.758
只修改主机与路径为文本地址 / Edit only host and path for the text URL

14
00:00:37.758 --> 00:00:40.613
将方法改为 PUT / Change the method to PUT

15
00:00:40.613 --> 00:00:43.458
打开请求 Body / Open request Body

16
00:00:43.458 --> 00:00:46.355
选择 Text，暂不输入 / Select Text before entering content

17
00:00:46.355 --> 00:00:49.355
输入中间态 Hello / Enter the intermediate text Hello

18
00:00:49.355 --> 00:00:52.204
继续输入为 Hello text / Complete the text as Hello text

19
00:00:52.204 --> 00:00:55.152
发送并核对 Hello text 字节 / Send and verify Hello text bytes

20
00:00:55.152 --> 00:00:58.002
回到 Query 表格 / Return to the Query table

21
00:00:58.002 --> 00:01:00.849
将 table 改为 current / Change table to current

22
00:01:00.849 --> 00:01:03.656
回到当前 Text 正文 / Return to the current Text body

23
00:01:03.656 --> 00:01:06.596
将正文改为 Hello replay / Change the body to Hello replay

24
00:01:06.596 --> 00:01:09.448
打开 Recent sends 菜单 / Open the Recent sends menu

25
00:01:09.448 --> 00:01:12.299
选回旧 POST 地址 / Select the earlier POST address

26
00:01:12.299 --> 00:01:15.166
检查 Query 仍为 current 与 again / Check that Query remains current and again

27
00:01:15.166 --> 00:01:18.037
再次 Send，核对追加的 Query 与当前正文 / Send again and verify appended Query and current body

28
00:01:18.037 --> 00:01:20.907
查看重发后保留的 Text 正文 / Inspect the Text body retained after replay
